flowchart TD
    %% Define Styles
    classDef external fill:#f9f9f9,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef process fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#0288d1,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef datastore fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#fbc02d,stroke-width:2px;

    %% External Entities
    User[App User]:::external
    Admin[App Admin]:::external
    GoogleAPI[Google API]:::external

    %% Processes (Level 1)
    P1((1.0<br>Session<br>Management)):::process
    P2((2.0<br>Fact Check<br>Analysis)):::process
    P3((3.0<br>Fake News<br>Reporting)):::process
    P4((4.0<br>Quiz & Learning<br>Assessment)):::process
    P5((5.0<br>Dashboard<br>Moderation)):::process

    %% Data Stores
    D1[(D1: User DB)]:::datastore
    D2[(D2: Reports DB)]:::datastore
    D3[(D3: i18n Locales)]:::datastore

    %% Data Flows: User
    User -->|Login credentials| P1
    User -->|Claim Text / Image Descs| P2
    User -->|Report submission Lat/Lng, details| P3
    User -->|Selected quiz options| P4
    User -->|Requests personal reports| P5

    %% Data Flows: Processes to Data Stores
    P1 -->|Stores current active user & role| D1
    P3 -->|Saves new Draft & Pending report| D2
    P4 -.->|Reads dynamic translated Qs| D3
    
    %% Data Flows: Data Stores to Processes
    D2 -->|Fetches report history / status| P5
    D1 -->|Verifies Admin/User context| P5

    %% Data Flows: Admin
    P5 -->|Shows all reports grid| Admin
    Admin -->|Updates report to Verified/Fake| P5
    P5 -->|Writes status back| D2

    %% Fact Check API Data Flow
    P2 -->|External GET check| GoogleAPI
    GoogleAPI -->|API Response| P2
    P2 -->|AI Heuristics & Confidence Score Result| User
